msgid ""
"顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 F4，不增加运行时转发。ILI9341、XPT2046、W25 继续通过公共 I/O "
"访问设备，留在组件目录，不随 MCU 支持包迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4, without "
"extra runtime forwarding. ILI9341, XPT2046 and W25 continue to use public "
"I/O and remain in components rather than moving with the MCU support "
"package."

msgid ""
"Board 和 SoC 不再加载本地 Python 插件。默认 Python 工具集中校验事实并生成静态连接； Core "
"`private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护整平台启动、停止、回滚与诊断，F4 "
"`private/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护 System 与共享资源的 C 协调；各自的 `.c` "
"公共入口复用同一实现，固定装配让编译器看到常量并裁剪分支。主机只维护 一套配置实现，其代码不进入 MCU 镜像。实际生成 factory、模型与 ARM"
" 产物 各自验证，不能把源码移动视为整条链路已经验收。 Native 必须显式启用测试 scope，不进入生产系列目录或能力聚合表。"
msgstr ""
"Board and SoC no longer load local Python plugins. Centralized Python tools "
"validate facts and generate static connections. Core "
"`private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns platform startup, stop, rollback "
"and diagnostics; F4 `private/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns C "
"coordination for System and shared resources. Their public `.c` entry points"
" reuse the same implementation; fixed assemblies expose constants to the "
"compiler for pruning. The host has one configuration implementation, whose "
"code is not linked into the MCU image. Generated factories, models and ARM "
"artifacts require separate validation; moving source does not establish "
"complete-path acceptance. Native requires explicit test scope and does not "
"enter production family directories or capability tables."

msgid ""
"精确支持见[支持参考](../reference/platforms/support.md)。重构前的目录与执行范围可从 "
"[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) "
"追溯；旧记录保留原始身份，不建立本次重构的软件候选或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"See the [support reference](../reference/platforms/support.md) for exact "
"support. Pre-refactor directories and execution scopes remain traceable at "
"the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). Old records retain"
" their original identities and do not establish software candidates or "
"physical-board qualification for this refactor."
